WEBVTT

00:12:58.667 --> 00:13:00.726
are shouting from the rooftops

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:03.351
that your policies
and your business practices

00:13:03.375 --> 00:13:05.792
are harming people and democracy.

00:13:06.875 --> 00:13:09.226
You own your decisions,

00:13:09.250 --> 00:13:12.917
but you can no longer say
that you couldn't have seen it coming.

00:13:14.167 --> 00:13:15.417
Thank you.